  "description": "It was a miserable day.  \nShe lived a life where she could not die.  \nRat, who lived in the slums, was in danger of being sold to a perverted nobleman.\n\n“P-please save me…!”\n\nHer first attempt at rebellion was easily thwarted, and she wondered if she would die like this.\n\n“You’re safe now.”\n\nShe is saved by a man she meets for the first time.  \nAnd a fantasy-like life is given to her.  \nShe gets to know her parents, who she thought never existed, and reclaims her real name, Irina.  \nAmong the kind-hearted people of the Winfried family, Irina heals her wounds and grows little by little.\n\n“Miss Irina, make sure you’re happy here.”\n\nThe man who saved her, Duke Logan Winfried.  \nIrina falls in love with him as if it were already set in place.\n\nBut why?  \nWhy do I feel empty somewhere even though our hearts are connected?  \nWhy do you look so distressed?\n\n“You said you wanted me to be happy.”\n\nSo do I.  \nI want you to be happy too.",
